.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Working documents and generated artifacts — kept on disk, not in git
# docs/ holds two different things. The DECISION LOG is markdown — findings,
# plans, specs, the architecture trace — 22 files and half a megabyte, and it
# is the only record of why this codebase is shaped the way it is. Ignoring it
# meant a clone lost every reason behind every constraint.
#
# The rest is generated: visual-check PNGs, rendered HTML, sequence JSON, ~4MB
# of artifacts a build produces and nobody reviews. Those stay out.
docs/*
!docs/**/
!docs/**/*.md
docs/**/*.visual-check.*
graphify-out/
